<h2 id=3D"protocols" class=3D"max-md:pr-4" data-state=3D"closed" style=3D"c=
ursor: pointer;">Protocols</h2>
<p>Lattice supports both <strong class=3D"font-semibold">REST</strong> and =
<strong class=3D"font-semibold">gRPC</strong> protocols, each optimized for=
 different integration patterns.
REST provides familiar HTTP/JSON workflows ideal for web applications and r=
apid development. gRPC offers
binary Protocol Buffers encoding for bandwidth-efficient hardware integrati=
ons.</p>
<p>Your protocol choice impacts authentication patterns, payload sizes, and=
 available APIs. The
<a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=3D"fern-mdx-link" href=3D"https:/=
/developer.anduril.com/guides/objects/overview">Objects API</a> for file op=
erations is only available via REST, while both
protocols provide full access to Entities and Tasks APIs.</p>
